    "Terminate the exact owned VM and verify termination and absence of its tagged EBS volumes. Verify network interfaces detached, then delete and verify the new security group.",
    "Read each of the four exact report keys at most once, validate aggregate schema and bindings, and fsync local reports before deleting remote report evidence.",
    "Apply and read back a deny-PutObject policy before object deletion. A policy readback is not claimed as an enforcement propagation test. Require the guest terminated, or all capabilities expired, before deletion.",
    "Delete only four exact report keys and the exact new bucket; independently verify bucket absence. Continue independent cleanup branches after failures.",
